1170
01:26:44,180 --> 01:26:46,805
the essential mystery of the body and the wine.

1171
01:26:47,207 --> 01:26:49,693
What's he trying to get across with that?

1172
01:26:49,712 --> 01:26:52,579
And this is, of course, my own interpretation.

1173
