1181
01:27:28,256 --> 01:27:31,119
It's that intuitive grasp of things.

1182
01:27:31,140 --> 01:27:37,006
So it's two sides of the same coin, the bread and wine, the awareness, and this intuitive grasp of things.

1183
01:27:37,606 --> 01:27:43,493
And that's what I think, and that's what I understood his teachings to be about.

1184
