1185
01:27:53,644 --> 01:27:56,087
Rowan Williams, yeah, very interesting, he said.

1186
01:27:57,502 --> 01:28:02,652
So once that was sorted, it sort of, you know, it made sense to me what he was trying to do.

1187
01:28:02,671 --> 01:28:09,904
Because I think, frankly, he was trying to lift the Jews out of monotheism into something beyond that.

1188
01:28:10,445 --> 01:28:15,395
In the same way that Hinduism moves from Vishnu, Brahma, and who's the other fellow?

1189
01:28:16,197 --> 01:28:17,298
Vishnu, Brahma, and?

1190
