A polytheistic religion isn't about morality, it's about power.

1206
01:29:07,077 --> 01:29:13,146
You need the gods to do what they were supposed to do, so you offer them sacrifices and all that sort of stuff.

1207
01:29:13,167 --> 01:29:16,832
The shift towards that, towards monotheism, was a complete shift.

1208
01:29:16,853 --> 01:29:27,048
And it all happened 2,500 years ago, with the Buddha, with what was happening in the Upanishads, with Lao Tzu, with Socrates, and with Moses.

1209
01:29:27,069 --> 01:29:29,832
That was a huge shift in human consciousness.

1210
01:29:30,394 --> 01:29:33,439
