1627
02:02:13,292 --> 02:02:16,018
And I think you will find that there are really

1628
02:02:15,997 --> 02:02:34,985
very beautiful expressions of gratitude and appreciation there and friendship and also some attempts to illustrate the dhamma which might give you a little bit of a fright who knows who knows what

1629
02:02:36,163 --> 02:02:51,591
