Infant Joy by William Blake.

1741
02:23:22,854 --> 02:23:23,777
I have no name.

1742
02:23:24,497 --> 02:23:25,719
I am but two days old.

1743
02:23:26,341 --> 02:23:27,343
What shall I call thee?

1744
02:23:28,325 --> 02:23:29,105
I happy am.

1745
02:23:29,647 --> 02:23:30,588
Joy is my name.

1746
02:23:31,370 --> 02:23:32,772
Sweet joy befall thee.

1747
02:23:33,613 --> 02:23:34,334
Pretty joy.

1748
02:23:34,915 --> 02:23:36,860
Sweet joy but two days old.

1749
02:23:37,501 --> 02:23:38,963
Sweet joy I call thee.

1750
